<title>JAPAN: Saudi cuts July Super Light price to Asia - traders.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts July Super Light price to Asia - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia said it will cut its term crude price for July-lifting Arab Super Light to Asian customers by 30 cents per barrel, traders here said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
